# mcp-server

Apply the mcp-server skill when the request matches its scope.

Capabilities:
- expose-skills-as-mcp-tools
- generate-skill-resources
- generate-workflow-prompts
- configure-transport

Stop when: MCP server configured with tools, resources, and prompts generated; transport exposed; artifact saved; completion criteria checked.
